  "name": "Fresh Tomato Salsa",
  "recipe_type": "appetizer",
  "brief_description": "Finely chopped Serrano chilies make this salsa nippy and nice. Combine with tomatoes, onions, cilantro and lime juice, and this salsa is ready for dipping.",
